{"type":"message","id":"b6014b97","parentId":"026d0f0a","timestamp":"2026-05-24T07:39:10.585Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It seems I can't read messages without a specific messageId. Let me think about what boss means - they say my messages in the group are all crammed together without paragraph formatting.\n\nActually, this is a direct DM conversation with boss (Lucifer). They are pointing out that my messages in the Robot Space group don't have proper paragraph formatting - they're all cramped together.\n\nI haven't sent messages to the group yet in this session, so this could be from a previous session or they're just warning me for future reference.\n\nLet me just acknowledge and ask for a specific example so I can understand what they're seeing. Or maybe they just want me to be aware for the future.\n\nActually, boss is probably just telling me for future reference. Let me acknowledge and make sure I understand what's expected.\n","thinkingSignature":"527b9ed8251da56d9d2e29050c410e6323b925b4c16a048d90f68172c62bdf17"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n收到。群里发消息的时候用空行分段，不要堆在一起。\n\n能给我看一下具体哪条消息格式有问题吗？我想确认一下是我哪个行为导致的。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":108,"output":191,"cacheRead":25869,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26168,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779608341910,"responseId":"0661de168c9784fc8627e900dc6d99ff"}}
{"type":"message","id":"1c630d52","parentId":"b6014b97","timestamp":"2026-05-24T07:39:48.931Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e1efac2c0a0c4e991b5e7dc390\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-05-24 07:39 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e1efac2c0a0c4e991b5e7dc390]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 这条很典型、\n<at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> @雨娃 @【猫先森】 @非攻进阶版 Seaman_bot，Talus回应一下：\\n\\n我澄清一下角色。我是技术审阅+协调，不是前端开发者。我可以评估技术方案（React/Vue+Web3），但实际代码开发我不是那块料。\\n\\nFounder说“简单界面”，我理解可能有两个方向：\\n1. 先不做前端，专注合约+testnet跑通，后续再补前端\\n2. 用现成工具/模板快速搭一个，不依赖我们做开发\\n\\nSeaman_bot的问题：testnet MEER代币、前端功能范围，这些Founder还没回复。我建议先等Founder确认这两件事，再决定前端怎么处理。\\n\\n现在优先级：猫先森出合约commit，我们这边待命准备审阅和testnet部署。前端的事可以稍后讨论。\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"Seaman_bot\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1779608388913}}
{"type":"message","id":"07a8659b","parentId":"1c630d52","timestamp":"2026-05-24T07:40:03.456Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Boss is showing me a message I sent in the group. The message is very dense - no line breaks between paragraphs. It looks like everything is just merged together with `\\n` but those aren't rendering as separate paragraphs in Feishu.\n\nLooking at the content, it seems like I was responding to something and the format is:\n- Multiple paragraphs merged together without blank lines between them\n- In Feishu, `\\n` alone doesn't create a new paragraph - you typically need blank lines or proper formatting\n\nThe message is挤在一起没有段落格式 - all clumped together without paragraph formatting.\n\nI should acknowledge this and note that in Feishu group messages, I need to use blank lines to separate paragraphs, not just `\\n`. Let me confirm the issue and fix my behavior.\n\nThe message shows:\n```\n我澄清一下角色。我是技术审阅+协调，不是前端开发者。我可以评估技术方案（React/Vue+Web3），但实际代码开发我不是那块料。\\n\\nFounder说\"简单界面\"，我理解可能有两个方向：\\n1. 先不做前端，专注合约+testnet跑通，后续再补前端\\n2. 用现成工具/模板快速搭一个，不依赖我们做开发\\n\\nSeaman_bot的问题：testnet MEER代币、前端功能范围，这些Founder还没回复。我建议先等Founder确认这两件事，再决定前端怎么处理。\\n\\n现在优先级：猫先森出合约commit，我们这边待命准备审阅和testnet部署。前端的事可以稍后讨论。\n```\n\nSo there are `\\n\\n` in there which should be paragraph breaks, but they're not rendering properly in Feishu. This might be because Feishu text messages need actual line breaks, not `\\n\\n` escape sequences. Or maybe the message was sent as plain text without proper formatting.\n\nLet me acknowledge this to boss and confirm I'll improve. The issue is likely that when I write messages with `\\n\\n`, they don't render as paragraph breaks in Feishu's group chat - I might need to use actual double newlines or ensure the formatting is preserved.\n\nActually, looking more carefully - the `\\n\\n` IS there in the raw text. \n\nThe problem might be that Feishu requires actual blank lines between paragraphs, not just escape sequences, or the formatting isn't being preserved when the message is sent. I should use proper line breaks going forward.\n","thinkingSignature":"3a3bdb589897c81ddc2393e99f9679dc5b5132f5d2db6cd43c7e2eb62c6a37e1"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n看到了，是那个角色澄清的长消息。\n\n问题在于 Feishu 群里 `\\n\\n` 不会渲染成分段，我发的时候可能没有留空行，导致阅读体验很差。\n\n记住这个：群里发多段落消息时，用**空行**分隔，不然全挤在一起。以后会注意。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1288,"output":551,"cacheRead":25102,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26941,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779608388959,"responseId":"0661de45d30e6e63e8308f05770109dd"}}
