{"type":"message","id":"9e27f586","parentId":"6c9f4178","timestamp":"2026-05-24T12:05:41.316Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"给 OpenClaw 特定 agent 设置模型的命令是 `gateway config.patch`。\n\n例如，如果你想设置 `lucus` 这个 agent 的主模型为 `google/gemini-2.5-flash`，命令是：\n\n```\ngateway config.patch path=agents.list.lucus.model.primary raw='\"\"google/gemini-2.5-flash\"\"' note=\"设置lucus的主模型\"\n```\n\n如果你要设置备用模型，路径是 `agents.list.lucus.model.fallbacks`，`raw` 字段需要一个 JSON 格式的列表。\n\n例如：\n\n```\ngateway config.patch path=agents.list.lucus.model.fallbacks raw='''[\"nvidia/deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro\", \"nvidia/deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash\"]''' note=\"设置lucus的备用模型\"\n```\n\n注意 `raw` 里的值需要是合法的 JSON 字符串，如果是字符串则用双引号包裹。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"google","model":"gemini-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779624335170,"responseId":"j-kSarO3IvWX0-kPpsWIgAI"}}
